
================================================================================
                       THE FROST-BITTEN AVIARY
================================================================================

You enter a room that has been magickally frost-bitten.

Snow and frost covers the ground, an icy pond leading perhaps
to an underground lake or to the outside, is in the far corner.

A few small black and white birds waddle around the room,
taking no notice of you.

================================================================================
                   TAB COMPLETION: A Powerful Shortcut
================================================================================

A wise adventurer does not type every letter of every word.

Press the TAB key after typing the first few letters of a
file or directory name, and the terminal will complete it
for you.

TRY IT NOW:
    Type:  cd h
    Then press TAB.

The terminal should complete it to:  cd hall

This works everywhere in the terminal — for file names,
directory names, and even some commands.  If there are
multiple matches, press TAB twice to see all options.

================================================================================
                       NAVIGATION
================================================================================

    cd hall          Enter the darkened hall ahead
    cd ..            Return to the courtyard
    pwd              Confirm your location

